d by $h(x) = 5^{x}$" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162573 1072 #uuid "93bb691b-3476-50ac-a75b-0f3bd8e04d2a" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162574 1068 #edb/ref 17592186160706 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162574 1069 "q-90846" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162574 1071 "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $f: R → R$ which is given by $f(x) = 3^{x}$?\n\n1. The range of $f$ is $(0, ∞)$\n2. $∀y ∈ R$, $∃x ∈ R$ such that $f(x) = y$\n3. $f$ maps $R$ **into** $R$" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162574 1072 #uuid "615b6ed0-1120-5f2d-a6c0-2c676050f1ce" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162575 1068 #edb/ref 17592186160712 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162575 1069 "q-90962" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162575 1071 "Which of the following functions are **into** functions?\n\n1. $f: [0, ∞) → [0, ∞)$ defined by $f(x) = \\sqrt{x + 4}$\n2. $g: R → [0, ∞)$ defined by $g(x) = \\mid x - 1 \\mid + 1$\n3. $h: (0, ∞) → [0, ∞)$ defined by $h(x) = \\sqrt{x}$" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162575 1072 #uuid "1f199dc0-996a-5afb-87b7-726903c9b0a9" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162576 1068 #edb/ref 17592186160718 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162576 1069 "q-91163" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162576 1071 "$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -3 \\\\ -3 & -6 & -9\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}3 & -9 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -3 \\\\ -9 & 9 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$\n\nBy applying elementary row operations of the form $R_{i}:=R_{i} + kR_{2}$, the matrix $A$ can be transformed into the matrix $B$. What are the elementary row operations?" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162576 1072 #uuid "200a95d9-6cef-55b2-a6a6-5c194d5765aa" 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162577 1068 #edb/ref 17592186160724 13194139533366 17592186045585 true] [17592186162577 1069 "q-91171" 1319413953336